flowchart LR
    subgraph Create[Create Draft]
        New[สร้าง Sale Lot] --> SelectItems[เลือก PO Items<br/>FIFO order]
        SelectItems --> AddExpenses[เพิ่มค่าใช้จ่าย<br/>ขนส่ง/อื่นๆ]
        AddExpenses --> Draft[Draft - ยังไม่ตัด stock]
    end
    subgraph Confirm[Confirm Sale]
        Draft --> Confirm[ยืนยันขาย]
        Confirm --> DeductStock[ตัด stock_kg]
        Confirm --> CalcProfit[คำนวณกำไร/ขาดทุน]
        CalcProfit --> Status[Status: confirmed]
    end
    subgraph Cancel[Cancel]
        Status --> CancelLot[ยกเลิก Lot]
        CancelLot --> RestoreStock[คืน stock_kg]
        CancelLot --> ReverseProfit[กลับกำไร]
        ReverseProfit --> Cancelled[Status: cancelled]
    end
